    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5b8ee4101c35299724b4ec2cc7833436.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5b8ee4101c35299724b4ec2cc7833436.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5b8ee4101c35299724b4ec2cc7833436.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Kitchen Confidence</strong> is a fast-paced restaurant <strong>management game</strong> grounded in real-world experience in the <strong>food-service industry</strong>. Enjoy the <strong>best of both worlds</strong> - short bursts of exhilarating <strong>action</strong> during rushhours, combined with the long-term <strong>planning and strategy</strong> of a management game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/6059cdc866193578484e7f346ab3cf40.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Assume the role of a restaurant business <strong>veteran</strong> who will be <strong>helping underperforming restaurants</strong> increase their efficiency and ultimately <strong>save their business</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9da46cefe8c4579ab1526256564a068c.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br><strong>Story mode</strong> will introduce a ton of <strong>colorful characters</strong> throughout the restaurant industry. When the <strong>player</strong> is ready to <strong>open</strong> their <strong>own restaurant</strong>, a team can be assembled to provide support.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/d6f930c4227faf5fe91717917ed5209d.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/d6f930c4227faf5fe91717917ed5209d.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/d6f930c4227faf5fe91717917ed5209d.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Each of these characters has their <strong>personality</strong>, so there may be some hiccups along the way, but even if it\u2019s not necessarily the best crew, <strong>they\u2019re your crew</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/6ddba166973e9024cb478d158fed43c9.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>It\u2019s up to the <strong>player to optimize</strong> and make the most of the <strong>restaurant</strong>. Decide the opening hours and the workers\u2019 timetables and hire new workers when needed!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/7559b5efd3125e3167eee0f6e95f5177.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Each <strong>worker</strong> has their <strong>strengths and abilities</strong>. Balance the worker's <strong>strong points</strong> and try not to get them too stressed, You never know what will happen! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9e15aa8c529aab4b974a5c7bf727ca50.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9e15aa8c529aab4b974a5c7bf727ca50.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9e15aa8c529aab4b974a5c7bf727ca50.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Every worker possesses unique statistics: <strong>stamina, stress tolerance</strong>, and <strong>speed</strong> along with individual <strong>traits</strong> that set them apart from one another.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/ee852127e0a6b90a0c5dffcdf7047b1f.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>The heat often rises in the kitchen. When there is <strong>suddenly an influx of customers</strong> and the job list just keeps on getting longer, it will take its <strong>toll on the crew</strong>. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/de54a345539e95ef23fac8b1de557404.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/de54a345539e95ef23fac8b1de557404.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/de54a345539e95ef23fac8b1de557404.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9317d40d856b9e18b5f30e89ee2837e0.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9317d40d856b9e18b5f30e89ee2837e0.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9317d40d856b9e18b5f30e89ee2837e0.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Stress</strong> effects are events that can affect the stressed-out crew member <strong>positively or negatively</strong>. Some chefs will <strong>thrive</strong> in stressful environments others <strong>crumble</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/a39d34ba0620a2602d83d6e6604441cc.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>At the start, <strong>players</strong> will engage with pre-existing <strong>menus</strong>. As they delve deeper into the game, they will have more <strong>creative freedom</strong>, although Story Characters will still offer suggestions for menu ideas. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/87b7aad3157fc272648375f3362a3c4e.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/87b7aad3157fc272648375f3362a3c4e.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/87b7aad3157fc272648375f3362a3c4e.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Designing a <strong>menu</strong> will be important as it will <strong>affect</strong> the <strong>type of customers</strong> that are interested in the restaurant and the costs. High-quality <strong>ingredients</strong> are expensive and they will <strong>spoil over time</strong>...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5499f7f1ed1d98b02a731892b7c1c32a.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Well-done <strong>preparations</strong> are the key to balancing the workload of the kitchen between slow and busy hours. <strong>Mise en place</strong> means exactly that, preparations. Preparing the needed ingredients beforehand will help make the <strong>dishes faster</strong> and the <strong>work less stressful</strong> for the crew.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/61163543af999fd22dd187df8ae8d8ca.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/61163543af999fd22dd187df8ae8d8ca.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/61163543af999fd22dd187df8ae8d8ca.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The <strong>amount to prepare</strong> beforehand is left for <strong>players</strong> to <strong>determine</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/a08e91082e4de194c26811b1e6fe7af6.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br><strong>Planning</strong> expenses and profits are important. There are many tools for the player to manage the flow of money like <strong>managing the staff</strong> and making sure <strong>nothing is wasted</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/72e287f9845fc93392e22bcec677ec55.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/72e287f9845fc93392e22bcec677ec55.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/72e287f9845fc93392e22bcec677ec55.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The player can <strong>order ingredients</strong> and <strong>establish prices</strong>. Top-quality ingredients and a good reputation will help to entice the customers! Every <strong>wholesaler</strong> operates with slight <strong>variations</strong> that cater to <strong>different play styles</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9f11c2c61822b91d3802949c54fd3434.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Sometimes the <strong>costs</strong> and <strong>taxes</strong> are too much and the player might end up <strong>bankrupt</strong> but do not worry, there are always loans! (There is a limit though...)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c277f08644f2ff4a150599e3816039ce.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>A <strong>robust build mode</strong> where players can design their <strong>dream restaurant</strong> and get the exact <strong>atmosphere</strong> they are looking for.  <strong>Designing</strong> the kitchen <strong>truly matters</strong>, cause with good design chefs can do their jobs more efficiently.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/abf567d78ca9e87d605e6df4b825668c.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/abf567d78ca9e87d605e6df4b825668c.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/abf567d78ca9e87d605e6df4b825668c.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>When players have learned the ropes. They can <strong>enhance</strong> the <strong>kitchen's flow</strong> with <strong>automation</strong>. <strong>Drawers</strong> function as furniture enabling the <strong>storage of limited quantities</strong> of ingredients conveniently adjacent to workstations. When stock runs dry chefs <strong>automatically refill</strong> the drawer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c779430ab15949ba25244447cd9e288f.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c779430ab15949ba25244447cd9e288f.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c779430ab15949ba25244447cd9e288f.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>....And much more!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5b8ee4101c35299724b4ec2cc7833436.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5b8ee4101c35299724b4ec2cc7833436.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5b8ee4101c35299724b4ec2cc7833436.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Kitchen Confidence</strong> is a fast-paced restaurant <strong>management game</strong> grounded in real-world experience in the <strong>food-service industry</strong>. Enjoy the <strong>best of both worlds</strong> - short bursts of exhilarating <strong>action</strong> during rushhours, combined with the long-term <strong>planning and strategy</strong> of a management game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/6059cdc866193578484e7f346ab3cf40.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Assume the role of a restaurant business <strong>veteran</strong> who will be <strong>helping underperforming restaurants</strong> increase their efficiency and ultimately <strong>save their business</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9da46cefe8c4579ab1526256564a068c.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br><strong>Story mode</strong> will introduce a ton of <strong>colorful characters</strong> throughout the restaurant industry. When the <strong>player</strong> is ready to <strong>open</strong> their <strong>own restaurant</strong>, a team can be assembled to provide support.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/d6f930c4227faf5fe91717917ed5209d.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/d6f930c4227faf5fe91717917ed5209d.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/d6f930c4227faf5fe91717917ed5209d.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Each of these characters has their <strong>personality</strong>, so there may be some hiccups along the way, but even if it\u2019s not necessarily the best crew, <strong>they\u2019re your crew</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/6ddba166973e9024cb478d158fed43c9.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>It\u2019s up to the <strong>player to optimize</strong> and make the most of the <strong>restaurant</strong>. Decide the opening hours and the workers\u2019 timetables and hire new workers when needed!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/7559b5efd3125e3167eee0f6e95f5177.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Each <strong>worker</strong> has their <strong>strengths and abilities</strong>. Balance the worker's <strong>strong points</strong> and try not to get them too stressed, You never know what will happen! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9e15aa8c529aab4b974a5c7bf727ca50.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9e15aa8c529aab4b974a5c7bf727ca50.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9e15aa8c529aab4b974a5c7bf727ca50.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Every worker possesses unique statistics: <strong>stamina, stress tolerance</strong>, and <strong>speed</strong> along with individual <strong>traits</strong> that set them apart from one another.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/ee852127e0a6b90a0c5dffcdf7047b1f.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>The heat often rises in the kitchen. When there is <strong>suddenly an influx of customers</strong> and the job list just keeps on getting longer, it will take its <strong>toll on the crew</strong>. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/de54a345539e95ef23fac8b1de557404.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/de54a345539e95ef23fac8b1de557404.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/de54a345539e95ef23fac8b1de557404.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9317d40d856b9e18b5f30e89ee2837e0.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9317d40d856b9e18b5f30e89ee2837e0.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9317d40d856b9e18b5f30e89ee2837e0.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Stress</strong> effects are events that can affect the stressed-out crew member <strong>positively or negatively</strong>. Some chefs will <strong>thrive</strong> in stressful environments others <strong>crumble</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/a39d34ba0620a2602d83d6e6604441cc.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>At the start, <strong>players</strong> will engage with pre-existing <strong>menus</strong>. As they delve deeper into the game, they will have more <strong>creative freedom</strong>, although Story Characters will still offer suggestions for menu ideas. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/87b7aad3157fc272648375f3362a3c4e.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/87b7aad3157fc272648375f3362a3c4e.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/87b7aad3157fc272648375f3362a3c4e.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Designing a <strong>menu</strong> will be important as it will <strong>affect</strong> the <strong>type of customers</strong> that are interested in the restaurant and the costs. High-quality <strong>ingredients</strong> are expensive and they will <strong>spoil over time</strong>...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/5499f7f1ed1d98b02a731892b7c1c32a.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Well-done <strong>preparations</strong> are the key to balancing the workload of the kitchen between slow and busy hours. <strong>Mise en place</strong> means exactly that, preparations. Preparing the needed ingredients beforehand will help make the <strong>dishes faster</strong> and the <strong>work less stressful</strong> for the crew.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/61163543af999fd22dd187df8ae8d8ca.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/61163543af999fd22dd187df8ae8d8ca.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/61163543af999fd22dd187df8ae8d8ca.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The <strong>amount to prepare</strong> beforehand is left for <strong>players</strong> to <strong>determine</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/a08e91082e4de194c26811b1e6fe7af6.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br><strong>Planning</strong> expenses and profits are important. There are many tools for the player to manage the flow of money like <strong>managing the staff</strong> and making sure <strong>nothing is wasted</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/72e287f9845fc93392e22bcec677ec55.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/72e287f9845fc93392e22bcec677ec55.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/72e287f9845fc93392e22bcec677ec55.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The player can <strong>order ingredients</strong> and <strong>establish prices</strong>. Top-quality ingredients and a good reputation will help to entice the customers! Every <strong>wholesaler</strong> operates with slight <strong>variations</strong> that cater to <strong>different play styles</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/9f11c2c61822b91d3802949c54fd3434.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>Sometimes the <strong>costs</strong> and <strong>taxes</strong> are too much and the player might end up <strong>bankrupt</strong> but do not worry, there are always loans! (There is a limit though...)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c277f08644f2ff4a150599e3816039ce.avif?t=1734355213\" /></div><br><br>A <strong>robust build mode</strong> where players can design their <strong>dream restaurant</strong> and get the exact <strong>atmosphere</strong> they are looking for.  <strong>Designing</strong> the kitchen <strong>truly matters</strong>, cause with good design chefs can do their jobs more efficiently.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/abf567d78ca9e87d605e6df4b825668c.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/abf567d78ca9e87d605e6df4b825668c.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/abf567d78ca9e87d605e6df4b825668c.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>When players have learned the ropes. They can <strong>enhance</strong> the <strong>kitchen's flow</strong> with <strong>automation</strong>. <strong>Drawers</strong> function as furniture enabling the <strong>storage of limited quantities</strong> of ingredients conveniently adjacent to workstations. When stock runs dry chefs <strong>automatically refill</strong> the drawer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c779430ab15949ba25244447cd9e288f.poster.avif?t=1734355213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c779430ab15949ba25244447cd9e288f.webm?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216290/extras/c779430ab15949ba25244447cd9e288f.mp4?t=1734355213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>....And much more!",
    "short_description": "Kitchen Confidence is a restaurant management game, with a pinch of humour. The player will get to manage different kinds of kitchens, and to open the restaurant of their dreams.",
